{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470790/extras/18638fea96d1c3009296ddac891957d6.avif?t=1772512274\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Limbo</strong>, <strong>Lust</strong>, <strong>Gluttony</strong>, <strong>Greed</strong>, <strong>Anger</strong>, <strong>Heresy</strong>, <strong>Violence</strong>, <strong>Fraud</strong>, and <strong>Treachery</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Each dominion is reigned by a ruler embodying the sin of their dominion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470790/extras/346999a22725969a722035ead28ae01f.poster.avif?t=1772512274\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470790/extras/346999a22725969a722035ead28ae01f.webm?t=1772512274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470790/extras/b53029c558efbf1788fb00a1fe7a0ef2.avif?t=1772512274\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A blend of Dante\u2019s Inferno and Lovecraftian horror. A <strong>first-person roguelike deckbuilder</strong> using the Major Arcana Tarot Cards to strategize against the horrors lurking in the darkness. <strong>Build the perfect deck</strong>, challenge each ruler of the 9 levels of hell, <i>die often</i>... and repeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470790/extras/20cb5dd0a1ea9b6cad0cbd8ec32cbaa1.poster.avif?t=1772512274\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470790/extras/20cb5dd0a1ea9b6cad0cbd8ec32cbaa1.webm?t=1772512274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470790/extras/acbc10d9713e73c9074c0a9726d3b4c7.avif?t=1772512274\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Pre-strategize and enhance your cards before battles. Apply sigils and brands to apply multiplying effects and push the odds in your favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470790/extras/a9deac85c2f1d8397ff5dddc57ba9c67.poster.avif?t=1772512274\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470790/extras/a9deac85c2f1d8397ff5dddc57ba9c67.webm?t=1772512274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470790/extras/4f29c291a58c387f85c1b3b4ed13575e.avif?t=1772512274\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The nightmarish creatures will catch you in the dark. Use the lantern to bend and manipulate the environment around you as you traverse through the Inferno. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your sanity will be put to the test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470790/extras/36f1a01f44224a8c0846ff814e7691c7.poster.avif?t=1772512274\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470790/extras/36f1a01f44224a8c0846ff814e7691c7.webm?t=1772512274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470790/extras/72747fbf8672edbd6c013d8165ff49e6.avif?t=1772512274\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>First-person Stealth</strong>: Evade the horrific creatures hunting for your soul.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Deckbuilding:</strong> Utilize the power of the Major Arcana Tarot Cards and grow their strength as you descend deeper.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Skill Trait Upgrades:</strong> Gamble your sanity through the underworld\u2019s blackmarket and gain new strengths\u2026 if you\u2019re lucky enough. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource Management:</strong> Harness the world\u2019s dwindling soul essences to solve challenges within each level.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470790/extras/2a62d80c486adf3bb96e900eddc7b02f.avif?t=1772512274\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470790/extras_big/2a62d80c486adf3bb96e900eddc7b02f.avif?t=1772512274 width=800 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span 