ps/2470790/extras/36f1a01f44224a8c0846ff814e7691c7.poster.avif?t=1772512274\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470790/extras/36f1a01f44224a8c0846ff814e7691c7.webm?t=1772512274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470790/extras/72747fbf8672edbd6c013d8165ff49e6.avif?t=1772512274\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>First-person Stealth</strong>: Evade the horrific creatures hunting for your soul.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Deckbuilding:</strong> Utilize the power of the Major Arcana Tarot Cards and grow their strength as you descend deeper.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Skill Trait Upgrades:</strong> Gamble your sanity through the underworld\u2019s blackmarket and gain new strengths\u2026 if you\u2019re lucky enough. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource Management:</strong> Harness the world\u2019s dwindling soul essences to solve challenges within each level.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470790/extras/2a62d80c486adf3bb96e900eddc7b02f.avif?t=1772512274\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470790/extras_big/2a62d80c486adf3bb96e900eddc7b02f.avif?t=1772512274 width=800 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470790/extras/8c0af71e10506da8fd8e67f546d87f33.avif?t=1772512274\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com